WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,340
Come and get the gold

2
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,060
If order is restored in the future

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,660
Gold can definitely be used as currency

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,140
Much more reliable than banknotes

5
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,230
Gold is small, highly valuable and not easy to break.

6
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:16,550
Keep it for future use

7
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,240
It's not dark yet, so it's convenient to tilt the fuel tank

8
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,360
Try to collect 5,000 liters of gasoline today

9
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:40,150
Save yourself the trouble of running around tomorrow and do it together

10
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:41,910
Finish early and go to bed early
